{"title":"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Proof_of_the_first_step\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Proof of the first step</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/a/9da67e012165785f89bd81df328c5e1790372288.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A^2_{}$\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/c/c8c9f2fbb1b23aace1f529f4864c0e28bd35eb52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A^{}_{}$\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" /> is the sum of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Absolute_value\" title=\"Absolute value\">absolute values</a> of all roots of the following equation:\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/2/b02f23aa1a41aa56a1e00e986776128fffe43321.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\sqrt{19} + \\frac{91}{{\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{{\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{{\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{{\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{x}}}}}}}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -40px\" width=\"267\" height=\"65\" /></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/b/00bde5d0b802b467943423634ec4f8cbaee50a97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\sqrt{19}+\\underbrace{\\frac{91}{\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{x}}}}}}_{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -62px\" width=\"269\" height=\"87\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/1/4317f7b98329fe311350839e380977e503fa3f0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"110\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/5/a15223614f54a87b5155974fc5a92615add5643a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2=x\\sqrt{19}+91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/3/fd31e58d94a12de411f491bbff2321ca52af0f82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-x\\sqrt{19}-91 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/f/5ff51e4b52c070c72f5fef8f1be62a9b6be87a8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left.\\begin{array}{l}x_1=\\frac{\\sqrt{19}+\\sqrt{383}}{2}\\\\\\\\x_2=\\frac{\\sqrt{19}-\\sqrt{383}}{2}\\end{array}\\right\\}A=|x_1|+|x_2|\\Rightarrow\\sqrt{383}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -29px\" width=\"335\" height=\"68\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/9/459dfb382fa2a24bf18abf0ff349198b8103c7d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A^2=\\boxed{383}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"84\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Proof_of_the_first_step\">Proof of the first step</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Proof of the first step\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Think about the set for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. The first element of this set is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/9/d191692120f9dc702358f84ffc1cf21bd96497fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"80\" height=\"38\" />. The next is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/9/32993c410829f64176d86698871fc03a65d1c00e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"134\" height=\"47\" />, and so on so forth. For simplicity, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/8/6485827f8f4cd4bba7ae0db9d112ff990e743275.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{A} = \\{\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{x},\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{x}}, \\dots \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"309\" height=\"47\" />. Then, notice that the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/2/382cea990fadd43376cf42e8e0597a5eb13a67c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"13\" /> containing first term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/9/32993c410829f64176d86698871fc03a65d1c00e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"134\" height=\"47\" /> is simply substituting the definition of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> into the first term of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/7/0b7bf42db84e4d2dbb7bf55476c12bf9f6233bc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, we can simply multiply each element of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/2/382cea990fadd43376cf42e8e0597a5eb13a67c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"13\" /> to obtain the same element of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/7/0b7bf42db84e4d2dbb7bf55476c12bf9f6233bc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />. Then, we can create a set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/e/42ecbfb5e7dd547c1e0ca2eeb4669f2cc7f1ae4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"10\" height=\"13\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/f/f7f212a2753e544cf95c19fadebb7e2d5bad6a3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{x}}}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -41px\" width=\"271\" height=\"66\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/1/4317f7b98329fe311350839e380977e503fa3f0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\sqrt{19}+\\frac{91}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"110\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>The motivation for this arises through showing a bijection between two infinite sets, and that they have the same number of elements.\n</p><p>Hope this helped.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/1/031cf65c1a214fd415337572549d1030fe17b9cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\sqrt{19} + \\frac{91}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"135\" height=\"37\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/f/30f938afb3bf29cdcf78c578c4f8459dc49d2ddc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = f(f(f(f(f(x)))))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"168\" height=\"18\" />, from which we realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/7/427c0ee5f10895f708b681a16c4f5799b31f41a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" />. This is because if we expand the entire expression, we will get a fraction of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/b/e3be814b276d269345565083785b043157b055d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{ax + b}{cx + d}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"52\" height=\"39\" /> on the right hand side, which makes the equation simplify to a quadratic. As this quadratic will have two roots, they must be the same roots as the quadratic <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/7/4874544e2638f3712dbb70e5ccf37558a5fc0acb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>The given finite expansion can then be easily seen to reduce to the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic_equation\" title=\"Quadratic equation\">quadratic equation</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/0/2202b0c53f3bf088b8c8af25cdee9298e6a8704a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{}^{2}-\\sqrt{19}x-91=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" />. The solutions are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/4/c24cc4b3bedd4045c123aff22e127d1ba503f1d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{\\pm}^{}=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/6/ac6cf5159660fced5067585ce0b461110fac67fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{19}\\pm\\sqrt{383}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"104\" height=\"43\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/0/db036f0b8eacca8af9fb872502481dc052a76810.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{}^{}=\\vert x_{+}\\vert+\\vert x_{-}\\vert=\\sqrt{383}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"191\" height=\"21\" />. We conclude that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/b/20b2aef2ade038afc62747a906615961a811a2ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{}^{2}=\\boxed{383}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"84\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME\" title=\"1991 AIME\">1991 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1991 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1991\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016231117\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.075 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 247/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1766/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 88/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6506/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.660      1 -total\n 57.75%    8.466      1 Template:AIME_box\n 40.59%    5.950      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2904:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016231117 and revision id 283888. Rendering w